    {
      "id": "1Lee6JUkcH2j65a9fi8O4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7226.6429224592275,
      "y": 700.4683197585031,
      "width": 1987.91775835035,
      "height": 748.5111587625433,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1i",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1285644883,
      "version": 233,
      "versionNonce": 1743027225,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781078266440,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "GetUserIdAndSecContext(&save_userid, &save_sec_context);\n // Save current security state\n\nif (OidIsValid(fcache->userid))\n        SetUserIdAndSecContext(fcache->userid, save_sec_context |\nSECURITY_LOCAL_USERID_CHANGE)\n\nthis is the exact SECURITY DEFINER implementation.\nOidIsValid(fcache->userid) ⇒ Do we have a valid owner role?\nSetUserIdAndSecContext(...) ⇒ Change current execution user\nfcache->userid ⇒ function owner\nSetUserIdAndSecContext(postgres, ...) ⇒ CurrentUserId = postgres",
      "fontSize": 49.900743917502886,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "GetUserIdAndSecContext(&save_userid, &save_sec_context);\n // Save current security state\n\nif (OidIsValid(fcache->userid))\n        SetUserIdAndSecContext(fcache->userid, save_sec_context | SECURITY_LOCAL_USERID_CHANGE)\n\nthis is the exact SECURITY DEFINER implementation.\nOidIsValid(fcache->userid) ⇒ Do we have a valid owner role?\nSetUserIdAndSecContext(...) ⇒ Change current execution user\nfcache->userid ⇒ function owner\nSetUserIdAndSecContext(postgres, ...) ⇒ CurrentUserId = postgres",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
