      "updated": 1781078266440,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "FunctionCallInvoke(fcinfo) => FunctionCallInvoke(fcinfo) => (*fcinfo->flinfo->fn_addr)(fcinfo)\n\nThis means now we will execute main function \nfmgr_info_cxt_security(...,true) but with user = postgres\n\nOuter fcinfo->flinfo => fn_addr = fmgr_security_definer\nWrapper replaces with: fcache->flinfo\nwhich contains: fn_addr = real function\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "FunctionCallInvoke(fcinfo) => FunctionCallInvoke(fcinfo) => (*fcinfo->flinfo->fn_addr)(fcinfo)\n\nThis means now we will execute main function \nfmgr_info_cxt_security(...,true) but with user = postgres\n\nOuter fcinfo->flinfo => fn_addr = fmgr_security_definer\nWrapper replaces with: fcache->flinfo\nwhich contains: fn_addr = real function\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
