      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Function language must be LANGUAGE SQL\nFunction body must be a single SELECT statement\nMust not return SETOF\nFunction should be IMMUTABLE or STABLE (VOLATILE usually blocks inlining)\nParameters must be safely substitutable into the query body\nCaller must have required permissions\nFunction must not be SECURITY DEFINER\nFunction should have a relatively simple query structure",
      "fontSize": 47.08064707045761,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Function language must be LANGUAGE SQL\nFunction body must be a single SELECT statement\nMust not return SETOF\nFunction should be IMMUTABLE or STABLE (VOLATILE usually blocks inlining)\nParameters must be safely substitutable into the query body\nCaller must have required permissions\nFunction must not be SECURITY DEFINER\nFunction should have a relatively simple query structure",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
